<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Pacifism Aura</ansi> mutation

You emit a subtle psychic field that dampens hostile intent in those
around you. Creatures are less likely to attack you unprovoked, but
the aura's influence makes it difficult to summon your own aggression
when needed.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Active Ability
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Very Rare

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Active ability: project a calming pulse to suppress aggression
  in nearby creatures
  Significantly reduced passive aggro generation — enemies are far
  less likely to fixate on you unprovoked

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  The same calming influence dulls your own fighting instincts —
  your combat effectiveness suffers

